Package: netkit
Title: Signed Network Reconstruction from Feature Matrices
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Netkit", "Authors", email = "maintainer@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools to reconstruct signed association networks from feature matrices
    and support downstream signed-network workflows. The current package focus
    is signed marginal reconstruction from already processed feature matrices,
    together with sign-preserving thresholding, graph conversion, signed
    community detection, and signed-aware layouts.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
